{"slug":"Universal-Script-XNO-piano-autoplayer-BETA-90774","_id":"6973fd037b4426d379d602d6","title":"XNO piano autoplayer BETA","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1769209091786.png","placeId":0},"features":"The XΞNO Vault Edition \" BETA \"\n\n1. Rhythm Engine (No Stutter)\n\nChord Sync: Hits everything in [], {}, or () at the exact same time so chords don't \"roll.\"\n\nSmart Spaces: Ignores single spaces but keeps double spaces as pauses so the timing doesn't break.\n\n0.005s Latency: Fast enough to play Rush E without hitting Roblox's limits.\n\n2. The Vault (+)\n\nAuto-Save: Saves your sheets to XenoVault.json on your PC so they’re there every time you join.\n\nCustom List: Store thousands of songs and swap them instantly with the LOAD button.\n\nClean Up: Simple DEL button to ditch sheets you don't want.\n\n3. Universal Character Support\n\nShift-Logic: Actually handles symbols like ! @ # by pressing Shift for you.\n\nFormat King: Reads standard [abc], advanced {abc}, and complex (abc) sheets perfectly.\n\n4. Performance UI\n\nBold Editor: Big text area using GothamBold so you can actually see the sheet while it's playing.\n\nTween Minimize: Smooth animation that tucks the menu away into a tiny bar.\n\nRightShift: Quick toggle to hide or show the whole thing.\n\nShould I add a search bar to the library so it's easier to find songs once you save a bunch?","tags":["Autoplayer","Piano","Piano autoplayer"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/AsBit6e7\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688","username":"qanona00","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"6890c11a437b179568cbc688","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":5396,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1769209091786.png","likeCount":6,"dislikeCount":2,"created